    "name": "From The Dark",
    "steam_appid": 3866620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow-paced, randomly generating dungeon crawler where the only source of light is you. Prioritize strength over visibility, speed over endurance, or\u00a0luminescence over power; it's your call. Survival isn't guaranteed regardless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/8a83545f81e8484e7f8788b533a48096.avif?t=1755639220\" width=800 height=275 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT AURA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel magic into a light to guide your path. Stronger items may take, and weaker may give. The more light you emit, the more you can see, but the easier you can be found. Find a good balance to use the dark to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/38c8c9c6c01e0b4eef70905b7df4a062.poster.avif?t=1755639220\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/38c8c9c6c01e0b4eef70905b7df4a062.webm?t=1755639220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/38c8c9c6c01e0b4eef70905b7df4a062.mp4?t=1755639220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During progression, you'll find a wide variety of items that will assist you on your journey. Swords, staffs, daggers, and bows will have their own pros and cons, and will force different playstyles. Equipment and armor items will provide buffs to certain stats, and sometimes they may grant passive abilities as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/c11fbe285848a2e0f15ef8638681ccf6.avif?t=1755639220\" data-has-big width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LABYRINTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the four regions. Gray and bland, and with the lack of landmarks, it's easy to get lost in. Haunted souls and rogue machines roam the place, creating a diverse but dangerous environment. Weapons are easy to find, but magic isn't well supported. The deeper you go, the darker it becomes. Something has to be down here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BURIED DESERT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ancient temples contain less machines and more organic, otherworldly beings. They're stronger, too, so come prepared. Magical items are easier to come by, but traversing the region may prove more difficult. One turn could lead to an old tomb, another to the next room, and one to a basement. There's no telling how deep these ruins go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/4da7920030ea48341c25d80725f8ab4d.avif?t=1755639220\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GREEN VALLEYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Covered in uncut grass and vines hanging from the ceiling, the Green Valleys conceal sneaky traps and artificially built animals that show no mercy. The terrain is rough, creating an uneven playing field for you and your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/90ae289277f34e77774601db32d47d16.avif?t=1755639220\" width=800 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE VILLAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The central safe hub for local residents, including you. Have some conversations. Learn more about your enemies, upgrade your gear, store your items, or even gamble a few of your shekels. Once your ready, the four paths surrounding the village will bring you where you need to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/ebd9348f4dcefcb1f3487314b4fa1597.avif?t=1755639220\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p>",
