more about your enemies, upgrade your gear, store your items, or even gamble a few of your shekels. Once your ready, the four paths surrounding the village will bring you where you need to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866620/extras/ebd9348f4dcefcb1f3487314b4fa1597.avif?t=1755639220\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p>",
